[Submission_1.Objectives]
Prevent attack
[Submission_1.Description]
The enemy is trying to accumulate forces to perform a strike along the road to the suburbs. Try to prevent a simultaneous attack by firing at the regrouping enemy units.
[NewSubmission.Success]
Mission accomplished: the battery is destroyed and its positions are overrun.
[NewSubmission.Failed]
Mission failed.
[Mission.Objectives]
Protect the suburb of Maknassy
[Mission.Description]
Take command of the defensive positions and prepare to repel the attack. Drive the enemy out from the Maknassy suburbs.
[Submission_2.Objectives]
Destroy artillery battery
[Submission_2.Description]
Enemy artillery battery is spotted, destroy it and clear the specified positions.
